hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"47","[AI-translation] Allah ne us ki sun li jis ne us ki tareef ki. [Ruku se uthte waqt kahe]"
"48","[AI-translation] Ae hamare Rab! Teri hi tareef, bahut, pakeeza aur babarkat tareef. [Ruku se uthkar kahe]"
"49","[AI-translation] [Teri hi tareef] aasman bhar, zameen bhar, dono ke darmiyan jo hai bhar aur is ke baad Tu jo chahe woh bhar [miqdar]. Tareef aur buzrugi ke laiq! Bande ka kaha sab se saccha kalam; hum sab tere bande hain: ae Allah! Tu jo de use rokne wala nahin, Tu jo roke use dene wala nahin; aur maldar ka maal tere pas faida nahin deta."
